    "Notes": "EnergyGainScalar (PvE 0.4 to 0.9, Round 4) and PVPEnergyGainScalar (PvP 0.4 to 1.15, Round 4) scale external and active Super energy gains directly (ActiveRegenScalars removed). Roaming Supers include the PvE ~3x active regeneration bonus (with PVPActiveRegenScalar preserving the base tier scalar in PvP); Prismatic Supers additionally receive a 0.9x PvP active regeneration penalty. Celestial Nighthawk and Pyrogale Gauntlets remove the roaming bonus (with Celestial Nighthawk preserving the 0.81x Prismatic PvP scalar via PVPActiveRegenOverride). Storm's Edge and Silkstrike updated to 500s; SuperDurationIncrease set to 33.33% (40.0s at 200 Super).",
